[{"title":"题喜鹊图二首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"对立梅梢似欲鸣，含情倾听却无声。\n摩挲醉眼行前看，不是生成是画成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39816,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还乡","author":"李昌祺","text":"淮水寒潮起暮云，纷纷离思不堪论。\n都门不闭还乡梦，昨夜分明到故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39817,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经凤台门","author":"李昌祺","text":"凤凰冈上閒原少，旧冢新坟次第排。\n黄壤岂能分贵贱，舆台将相一般埋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉中遣兴","author":"李昌祺","text":"眼前无物不关情，浊酒从教醉复醒。\n醉里不知为客久，金陵却道是庐陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日对菊","author":"李昌祺","text":"席有尘埃径有苔，旧时知己少曾来。\n多情独爱庭前菊，肯不羞贫岁岁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游灵谷寺","author":"李昌祺","text":"十丈浮屠万叠山，谁移兜率下人寰。\n非因酷爱僧房好，贪看青松忘却还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别","author":"李昌祺","text":"壶倾酒尽棹歌催，日影平西送骑回。\n最是秋风怜客别，沙头缓送布帆开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上作","author":"李昌祺","text":"野水浮云任所之，渚鸥汀鹭识心期。\n闲身到处贫无物，只有唐人几卷诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题五峰僧寺悼住此庵上人","author":"李昌祺","text":"旅食京华七度秋，重来无处觅汤休。\n万株松树千竿竹，梦寐平生旧此游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼王翁二首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"随分棺衾足掩身，不劳吊客叹家贫。\n白头赢得青山葬，多少寒沙暴骨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼王翁二首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"海上归来牖下终，去时同伴葬辽东。\n重泉莫叹桐棺薄，玉匣籧篨等是空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小窗夏日即景","author":"李昌祺","text":"树影轮囷日影微，槿花烂漫芷花稀。\n青蝇不畏儒衡扇，何处争来撩乱飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱给事自南中回相过","author":"李昌祺","text":"瘴海归来话旧游，低头长揖泪交流。\n伤心忍说来时事，半里盘滩万髑髅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灊峰老僧","author":"李昌祺","text":"南礼曹溪北五台，双眉覆面眼慵开。\n不知僧腊今多少，庭桧参天手自栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿正觉寺僧房","author":"李昌祺","text":"露鹤寒猿永夜清，山僧入定泯群情。\n幽人独向阶前坐，为惜千峰好月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北京送人南归二首 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"衣染缁尘鬓欲华，病身飘泊在天涯。\n角声吹断还乡梦，只到金陵不到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北京送人南归二首 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"宦况乡心共寂寥，秋蓬凉苇总萧萧。\n西风似欲留人住，吹得垂杨挽去桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归次吕梁洪","author":"李昌祺","text":"吕梁洪水激冲波，桂楫兰桡此处多。\n去日少年归日老，人生能得几回过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊龙潭","author":"李昌祺","text":"南辕北辙尽何求，鬓不如霜不肯休。\n输却江天渔妇火，寻常夜夜照扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园精舍","author":"李昌祺","text":"社近芳花烂漫开，不关风雨自沾苔。\n幽禽惊避苍鹰逐，乱入香红飐下来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村舍燕","author":"李昌祺","text":"垒破频频旋补泥，双飞双语更双栖。\n雕梁虽贵茅檐稳，暮去朝来莫怨低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洧川田翁","author":"李昌祺","text":"辛勤雨垄复烟畴，醉卧槐阴石枕头。\n少小为农今老大，不曾骑马只骑牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田妇","author":"李昌祺","text":"谙尽条桑与艺麻，岂知城市有繁华。\n年年看得蚕丝熟，不入贫家入富家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿金乡铺","author":"李昌祺","text":"寂寞邮亭户半扃，茅茨破处见疏星。\n四无邻舍舆台睡，露自成霜水自冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兴国寺与僧话禅","author":"李昌祺","text":"僻性长嫌驿舍喧，蒲团到处宿祗园。\n机锋已被曼殊逗，可是毗耶更有言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b0391