uthor":"李昌祺","text":"荒城晏岁野僧房，迢递他乡忆故乡。\n病骨不禁风雪冷，一更浑似一旬长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿僧寺三首 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"空房不见款冬花，檐铎敲风日影斜。\n随意看来随意脱，绯袍那似佛袈裟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹅鸭池","author":"李昌祺","text":"水面残冰漾浅漪，临流驻马立多时。\n不因常侍成奇迹，千载谁知有此池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荥阳怀古","author":"李昌祺","text":"广武城边古战场，汉高曾此割封疆。\n若无纪信乘黄屋，纵有萧韩事叵量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花答","author":"李昌祺","text":"多谢天公著意栽，不教妆点艳亭台。\n无人剪折无人赏，赢得年年自在开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题怪石牡丹孔雀图","author":"李昌祺","text":"不上屏风不用怜，钿毫金缕烂相鲜。\n双瞳赢得无人射，翘立花妃石丈前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过张茅镇见饥民","author":"李昌祺","text":"土洞深沈土坑欹，田园枯旱废耕犁。\n一身馁困浑无力，犹上高梯剥树皮。","collection":"