"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"垂垂一簇石崖旁，雅韵幽姿冠楚芳。\n天不遣生平地上，可怜分付许多香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其二","author":"李昌祺","text":"阴崖石髓养根芽，半吐全开总是花。\n谩有国香谁见采，美人迢递在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其三","author":"李昌祺","text":"沅湘三月雨嘈嘈，长得新苗尺许高。\n惟有江潭憔悴叟，行吟收拾入离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其四","author":"李昌祺","text":"懒共江篱杜若荣，聊依藓石寄幽情。\n试观种在阶庭者，未必天然似此清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其五","author":"李昌祺","text":"寂寞孤丛棘石边，自荣自悴自清妍。\n空山零落知多少，垂老看图一慨然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题兰 其六","author":"李昌祺","text":"湘女祠前半夕晖，采芳纫佩志空违。\n年年绿遍东风里，肠断王孙去不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题牡丹 其一","author":"李昌祺","text":"清平新调缓声歌，醉眼懵腾看锦窠。\n今日江南林下见，满